The first Note to Assessor is incomplete. The second Note does not apply to this development or
annexation. (Planning Staff Note: Condition.)

Development: Eric Hammer
City planning staff is directed to use W.S. 15-1-402 as the review criteria for annexations. Staff
finds that:

i.
This annexation is for the protection of the health safety and welfare of persons who are
anticipated to reside within this area and for those residing in the City. Quality city water
and sanitary sewer services will be provided, after extended at the expense of the owner,
to this property.

ii.
This land is currently within Laramie County, adjacent to the City. The vast majority of the
property is currently within the Urban Service Boundary. Future residents of land will be a
part of the Cheyenne economy and social fabric.

iii.
This annexation is a logical and feasible addition to the City and the developers of this
